{"text": "At last she took out one match. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And struck it on the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The match burned. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a bright flame. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like a tiny candle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly she seemed to be sitting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In front of a big iron stove. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The fire was burning brightly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And it was so warm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She stretched out her feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To warm them, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the flame went out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the stove was gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She struck another match. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the wall became as thin as a veil. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She could see into a room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a big table. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the white table. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a roast goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Stuffed with apples and plums. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the goose jumped down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And walked toward the girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the match went out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And there was only the cold wall.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "t", "o", "o", "k", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "s", "t", "r", "u", "c", "k", " ", "i", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", " ", "b", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h